{{ENExclusive}}
{{PageBanner|Clb l 014 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[The Battle Cats]] and the puzzle mobile game known as '''Tower of Saviors''' was held from May 6th, 2024 to May 20th, 2024. The collaboration includes an [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during the collaboration period.<br>
The game is published by [https://www.madhead.com Mad Head Limited].

==Event Information==
The worlds of Tower of Saviors and The Battle Cats cross in a special collab event! Join the Cats in their journey to rid a far-off continent of the chaos that plagues it!<br>
{{Color|#6554C0|'''On from May 6 (11:00AM) until May 20 (10:59AM), 2024!}}

{{Color|#FF991F|'''● Tower of Saviors Capsules Now Available!'''}}<br>
Collect collab-only characters like {{Color|#006644|'''Voluptuous Peony - Daji'''}} and {{Color|#0747A6|'''Mollyanna Cat'''}} from a limited Capsule set! Featured heroes include:<br>
[[Voluptuous Peony - Daji (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#006644|'''Voluptuous Peony - Daji (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Mystical nine-tailed fox commanding powerful magic who deals Massive damage to Floating and Angels with 100% Slow.<br>
[[Mollyanna Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#0747A6|'''Mollyanna Cat (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Cat admirer of the young lady guiding travellers through the Tower of Saviors. Sometimes Freezes Zombies.

※Players will have a set chance to collect units listed above from Rare Capsule draws from the Tower of Saviors set during this collab event. (Units other than collab units may also appear.)<br>
※Tower of Saviors collab units will not appear from draws made from other Rare Capsule sets. Tap the button at the top of the Rare Capsules screen to select the Tower of Saviors banner before making your draw.<br>
※You must update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats app to access this Tower of Saviors set.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''●Limited Collab Hero on Sale!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#BF2600|'''Event-exclusive Special character'''}} [[Dotty Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#BF2600|'''Dotty Cat'''}}]] is available for purchase during the Tower of Saviors event!<br>
Tap the button at the top-right of the Cat Base to purchase the Dotty Cat set, which also includes XP and Cat Food. Plus, Dotty Cat gains the Strong Against Angels ability when evolved!<br>
Don't miss this chance to collect this collab-exclusive unit!

※Only one Dotty Cat can be purchased per account.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''● New Collab Stages Added!'''}}<br>
Enter the strange, looming tower in the distance! Characters from Tower of Saviors make their appearance as fierce enemies in tough stages! Check out this limited-time challenge at the Collab Stages section of the Event Stages/Legend Stages!

※If the collab stages do not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Collab Stage: Era of Enoch'''}}<br>
Collect awesome rewards based on the score earned after clearing these Timed Score stages! {{Color|#BF2600|'''30 Cat Food'''}} is yours to claim after clearing the final stage of this map for the first time!

※If collab stages do not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Collab Stage: Battle with Madhead!'''}}<br>
Go head-to-head with Madhead for a chance at big XP rewards! Get bigger XP rewards with higher scores!<br>
There's also a small chance to collect {{Color|#0747A6|'''limited collab unit'''}} [[Madhead (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#0747A6|'''Madhead'''}}]] after clearing the stage! Earning victory at tougher versions of this stage will result in a higher chance of unlocking Madhead as a stage clear reward.

※Using a Treasure Radar will give you a 100% chance to receive Madhead.<br>
※Madhead can be activated at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu after being collected as a stage reward.<br>
※Rewards can be checked by tapping the button at the bottom-right of the Stage selection screen.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''● Collab Stage: Ascend the Tower of Saviors'''}}<br>
Starting the second week of the event, a new Gauntlet stage will be available {{Color|#403294|'''from May 13 (11:00AM) until May 20 (10:59AM)!'''}}

Select Ascend the Tower of Saviors from the Collab Stages section of the Event Stages/Legend Stages to try this {{Color|#BF2600|'''10-stage challenge'''}} where enemies get stronger the farther you progress!<br>
Each stage has its own clear reward, so be sure to get them all!

{{Color|#FF991F|'''● Limited-Time Special Missions added to Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
New Catnip Challenges missions inspired by Tower of Saviors have been added just for this collab event! Clear the missions during the collab to collect special rewards!

※Tower of Saviors Special missions can only be completed until May 20th, 2024 at 10:59am. Don't forget to claim your rewards before then!

{{Color|#FF991F|'''●Login each day during the campaign for awesome rewards!'''}}
The first time each day you visit the Cat Base during this collab event, you will be rewarded with a login stamp and another item reward. Log in for 5 days to receive collab-exclusive unit [[Felix the Cat Duke Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#403294|'''Felix the Cat Duke Cat'''}}]]!

※Up to 14 stamps can be collected throughout the event.<br>
※After unlocking Felix the Cat Duke Cat, you can activate it by visiting the Special Cat section of the Upgrade menu.

